# The build context is the repo root; keep it small and keep local state out of the image.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/.git
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.env
apps/engine/facts
data/licensed/*
!data/licensed/README.md
data/raw/*.zip

# Local SQLite databases. DATABASE_URL defaults to `sqlite+aiosqlite:///./test.db`, so a plain
# `uvicorn app.main:app` in apps/engine leaves one behind — it holds proposals and must never be
# committed or baked into an image.
**/test.db
**/*.sqlite
**/*.sqlite3
apps/engine/*.db
